x]]:translate-y-[2px] text-right whitespace-nowrap">Oct 2022</td><td class="p-2 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-right">$44.0 /1k imgs<!-- --></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="mt-8 text-xs text-neutral-500"><sup>1</sup> <!-- -->API Pricing reflects the cost to generate 1,000 images on the model creator&#x27;s API at 1024x1024 with the model&#x27;s default settings</p></div><div class="w-full border-b pb-3 mb-6 space-y-2 mt-10"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div><div class="w-full mb-12"><div class="w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_4nav9fiv5tabsrb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_nav9fiv5tabsrb_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-45 text-left font-medium text-base border-b pb-2 mb-4 hover:no-underline" data-radix-collection-item="">Which is the best Text to Image AI model?<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-neutral-600"><path d="M8 2.75C8 2.47386 7.77614 2.25 7.5 2.25C7.22386 2.25 7 2.47386 7 2.75V7H2.75C2.47386 7 2.25 7.22386 2.25 7.5C2.25 7.77614 2.47386 8 2.75 8H7V12.25C7 12.5261 7.22386 12.75 7.5 12.75C7.77614 12.75 8 12.5261 8 12.25V8H12.25C12.5261 8 12.75 7.77614 12.75 7.5C12.75 7.22386 12.5261 7 12.25 7H8V2.75Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_4nav9fiv5tabsrb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_nav9fiv5tabsrb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 text-sm" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);max-height:0px;opacity:0"><div class="pb-4 pt-0"><p class="text-neutral-700">GPT Image 2 (high) currently leads the Artificial Analysis Text to Image Arena with an Elo score of 1369.</p></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_57av9fiv5tabsrb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_17av9fiv5tabsrb_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-45 text-left font-medium text-base border-b pb-2 mb-4 hover:no-underline" data-radix-collection-item="">What are the top Text to Image models?<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-neutral-600"><path d="M8 2.75C8 2.47386 7.77614 2.25 7.5 2.25C7.22386 2.25 7 2.47386 7 2.75V7H2.75C2.47386 7 2.25 7.22386 2.25 7.5C2.25 7.77614 2.47386 8 2.75 8H7V12.25C7 12.5261 7.22386 12.75 7.5 12.75C7.77614 12.75 8 12.5261 8 12.25V8H12.25C12.5261 8 12.75 7.77614 12.75 7.5C12.75 7.22386 12.5261 7 12.25 7H8V2.75Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_57av9fiv5tabsrb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_17av9fiv5tabsrb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 text-sm" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);max-height:0px;opacity:0"><div class="pb-4 pt-0"><p class="text-neutral-700">The top Text to Image models by Elo rating are: 1. GPT Image 2 (high) (Elo 1369), 2. Reve 2.1 (Elo 1322), 3. Nano Banana 2 (Gemini 3.1 Flash Image Preview) (Elo 1320), 4. GPT Image 1.5 (high) (Elo 1310), 5. MAI-Image-2.5 (Elo 1305). Rankings are based on blind user votes in the Artificial Analysis Image Arena.</p></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_5nav9fiv5tabsrb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_1nav9fiv5tabsrb_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-45 text-left font-medium text-base border-b pb-2 mb-4 hover:no-underline" data-radix-collection-item="">How are Text to Image models ranked on this leaderboard?<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-neutral-600"><path d="M8 2.75C8 2.47386 7.77614 2.25 7.5 2.25C7.22386 2.25 7 2.47386 7 2.75V7H2.75C2.47386 7 2.25 7.22386 2.25 7.5C2.25 7.77614 2.47386 8 2.75 8H7V12.25C7 12.5261 7.22386 12.75 7.5 12.75C7.77614 12.75 8 12.5261 8 12.25V8H12.25C12.5261 8 12.75 7.77614 12.75 7.5C12.75 7.22386 12.5261 7 12.25 7H8V2.75Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_5nav9fiv5tabsrb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1nav9fiv5tabsrb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 text-sm" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);max-height:0px;opacity:0"><div class="pb-4 pt-0"><p class="text-neutral-700">Models are ranked using an Elo rating system derived from user votes in blind comparisons in the Artificial Analysis Image Arena. Users compare two images generated from the same prompt without knowing which model created each image. Higher Elo scores indicate a model is preferred more often by users.<!-- --> <a class="underline hover:text-foreground" href="/image/arena">Vote in the Artificial Analysis Image Arena</a></p></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_67av9fiv5tabsrb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_27av9fiv5tabsrb_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-45 text-left font-medium text-base border-b pb-2 mb-4 hover:no-underline" data-radix-collection-item="">What Elo score does GPT Image 2 (high) have?<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-neutral-600"><path d="M8 2.75C8 2.47386 7.77614 2.25 7.5 2.25C7.22386 2.25 7 2.47386 7 2.75V7H2.75C2.47386 7 2.25 7.22386 2.25 7.5C2.25 7.77614 2.47386 8 2.75 8H7V12.25C7 12.5261 7.22386 12.75 7.5 12.75C7.77614 12.75 8 12.5261 8 12.25V8H12.25C12.5261 8 12.75 7.77614 12.75 7.5C12.75 7.22386 12.5261 7 12.25 7H8V2.75Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_67av9fiv5tabsrb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_27av9fiv5tabsrb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 text-sm" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);max-height:0px;opacity:0"><div class="pb-4 pt-0"><p class="text-neutral-700">GPT Image 2 (high) has an Elo score of 1369 across 14,724 comparisons on the Text to Image Leaderboard.</p></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_6nav9fiv5tabsrb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_2nav9fiv5tabsrb_" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 transition-all [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-45 text-left font-medium text-base border-b pb-2 mb-4 hover:no-underline" data-radix-collection-item="">Which is the best open weights Text to Image model?<svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-neutral-600"><path d="M8 2.75C8 2.47386 7.77614 2.25 7.5 2.25C7.22386 2.25 7 2.47386 7 2.75V7H2.75C2.47386 7 2.25 7.22386 2.25 7.5C2.25 7.77614 2.47386 8 2.75 8H7V12.25C7 12.5261 7.22386 12.75 7.5 12.75C7.77614 12.75 8 12.5261 8 12.25V8H12.25C12.5261 8 12.75 7.77614 12.75 7.5C12.75 7.22386 12.5261 7 12.25 7H8V2.75Z" fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_6nav9fiv5tabsrb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_2nav9fiv5tabsrb_" data-orientation="vertical" class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 text-sm" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);max-height:0px;opacity:0"><div class="pb-4 pt-0"><p class="text-neutral-700">Ideogram 4.0 currently leads among open weights models in the Artificial Analysis Text to Image Arena with an Elo score of 1220, followed by Ideogram 4.0 (Quality) (Elo 1216) and FLUX.2 [dev] Turbo (Elo 1200).</p></div></div></div></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Which is the best Text to Image AI model?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"GPT Image 2 (high) currently leads the Artificial Analysis Text to Image Arena with an Elo score of 1369."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the top Text to Image models?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Th