-base border-b pb-2 mb-4 hover:no-underline\",\"children\":\"How are Text to Image models ranked on this leaderboard?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L913\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-neutral-700\",\"children\":[\"Models are ranked using an Elo rating system derived from user votes in blind comparisons in the Artificial Analysis Image Arena. Users compare two images generated from the same prompt without knowing which model created each image. Higher Elo scores indicate a model is preferred more often by users.\",[\" \",[\"$\",\"$L22\",null,{\"href\":\"/image/arena\",\"className\":\"underline hover:text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Vote in the Artificial Analysis Image Arena\"}]]]}]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"916:[\"$\",\"$L911\",\"What Elo score does GPT Image 2 (high) have?-3\",{\"value\":\"item-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L912\",null,{\"className\":\"text-left font-medium text-base border-b pb-2 mb-4 hover:no-underline\",\"children\":\"What Elo score does GPT Image 2 (high) have?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L913\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-neutral-700\",\"children\":[\"GPT Image 2 (high) has an Elo score of 1369 across 14,724 comparisons on the Text to Image Leaderboard.\",\"$undefined\"]}]}]]}]\n917:[\"$\",\"$L911\",\"Which is the best open weights Text to Image model?-4\",{\"value\":\"item-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L912\",null,{\"className\":\"text-left font-medium text-base border-b pb-2 mb-4 hover:no-underline\",\"children\":\"Which is the best open weights Text to Image model?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L913\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-neutral-700\",\"children\":[\"Ideogram 4.0 currently leads among open weights models in the Artificial Analysis Text to Image Arena with an Elo score of 1220, followed by Ideogram 4.0 (Quality) (Elo 1216) and FLUX.2 [dev] Turbo (Elo 1200).\",\"$undefined\"]}]}]]}]\n919:T6af,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\"